 "description": [
  "Manifest of the provider cache of the desktop prototype (provider_cache.py).",
  "One entry per provider/stage that stages/lane1.sh..lane4.sh build. Paths under",
  "'recipes', 'recipe', 'uses' and 'locks' are relative to the repository root;",
  "'marker' is relative to P/<provider>; 'fetched' selects records of",
  "status/fetch.json. 'invocation' is the argv/env template the lane runs in the",
  "toolchain image: {root} is the work root, {repo} the repository, {timestamp} a",
  "run-time value that is never rendered, and the other names come from",
  "'variables'. Changing anything a provider's key is derived from gives it, and",
  "every provider downstream of it, a new key."
